# Ollama setup for saudi-receptionist-gemma-4-12b (Gemma 4's own tool format).
#   ollama create saudi-receptionist-gemma -f Modelfile.gemma
# Call /api/chat with "tools" and "think": false. Thinking must stay off: the model was trained and tested that way.

